        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you ensure food and nutrition ads comply with FSSAI and Meta healthcare advertising policies?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We craft clean-label, certified nutrition-focused ad copy highlighting certified FSSAI approvals, real ingredients, and genuine taste benefits without making exaggerated or misleading medical cure claims."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How soon can a food brand expect to see an increase in online sales?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Meta Ads and Google Shopping generate direct D2C orders and Quick Commerce sales within 24 to 48 hours of campaign launch. B2B wholesale distributor pipelines establish steady multi-lakh monthly contracts within 30 to 45 days."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do food influencer gifting and taste review collaborations work?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We manage micro and macro food creator gifting campaigns, securing genuine taste-test video reviews, unboxing reactions, and recipe features that build massive social proof across Instagram and YouTube."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you track Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC) and customer Lifetime Value (LTV)?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We integrate GA4 e-commerce tracking, Shopify/WooCommerce analytics, and Meta CAPI to measure blended CAC, cohort repeat purchase frequency, Average Order Value (AOV), and 90-day customer lifetime revenue."
